{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16559","headline":"送王伦 · 刘复","name":"送王伦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春江日未曛，楚客酣送君。\n翩翩孤黄鹤，万里沧洲云。\n四方各有志，岂得常顾羣。\n山连巴湘远，水与荆吴分。\n清光日修阻，尺素安可论。\n相思寄梦寐，瑶草空氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}